      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "operation": {
          "const": "get_management_url",
          "default": "get_management_url",
          "description": "Retrieves a direct URL to the admin portal for a specific training. The request identifies the organizer and the training; the response provides a link the organizer can use to manage or launch the training in the admin portal. The training organizer will be required to log in. You can schedule and manage the training (e.g., add tests, polls and training materials) from the URL provided in the response.\n",
